'''Dagiti Baliscans''' ({{langx|bl|dagiti baliscanos|label=}}); {{langx|hil|Mga Dagiti sa Baliskan}}) consists of people of full or partial [[Dagit|Dagiti]] descent who were born in or immigrated to [[Balisca]]. 

